    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Background</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the protagonist takes the subway home after work and accidentally enters a superliminal space. She must follow clues to find keys that unlock doors to the next station, with each door hiding different dangers and secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On average, 30-45 minutes, though exploring all elements may require more time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on experience, with simple gameplay that involves basic interactions with objects in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple entities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythological stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements of fright and horror</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Background</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the protagonist takes the subway home after work and accidentally enters a superliminal space. She must follow clues to find keys that unlock doors to the next station, with each door hiding different dangers and secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On average, 30-45 minutes, though exploring all elements may require more time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on experience, with simple gameplay that involves basic interactions with objects in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple entities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythological stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements of fright and horror</p></li></ul>",
